::  modules/blaze/glow/gate-blaze-weave-step.glow -- Monotonic Weave Step!
/!  16384
|%
++  gate-blaze-weave-step
  |=  [next-gen=@ud prev-gen=@ud]                       ::  monotonic weave
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  strict step delta
  ~|  'blaze-weave-generation-rollback-refused'         ::  append-only fold
  ?>  (gth next-gen prev-gen)                           ::  strictly forward
  (sub next-gen prev-gen)
--
